{"id":153,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Bayleef’s neck is ringed by curled-up leaves. Inside each tubular leaf is a small shoot of a tree. The fragrance of this shoot makes people peppy."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"The buds that ring its neck give off a spicy aroma that perks people up."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"A spicy aroma emanates from around its neck. The aroma acts as a stimulant to restore health."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"The scent of spices comes from around its neck. Somehow, sniffing it makes you want to fight."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A BAYLEEF’s neck is ringed by curled-up leaves. Inside each leaf is a small tree shoot. The fragrance of this shoot makes people peppy."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"The scent that wafts from the leaves on its neck causes anyone who smells it to become energetic."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Overgrow","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Grass-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Leaf Guard","hidden":true,"description":"Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Grass"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Green","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":152,"name":"Chikorita","condition":null,"children":[{"id":153,"name":"Bayleef","condition":"Lv. 16","children":[{"id":154,"name":"Meganium","condition":"Lv. 32","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[1,75],[1,77],[12,235],[18,115],[22,345],[26,73],[32,230],[36,113],[40,34],[46,219],[50,202],[54,76]],"machine":[34,331,204,174,38,227,203,412,263,313,202,447,520,803,580,270,282,437,113,345,189,182,115,156,402,214,76,669,707,164,241,14,36,851,885],"egg":[246,68,175,505,275,22],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-9","name":"Bayleef","set":"Ascended Heroes","dat